			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"大伴",
					"萊內"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 726930101,
					"content": "#{M#小哥}{F#姑娘}，{F#妳}{M#你}來了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726930102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "大伴"
				},
				{
					"id": 726930102,
					"content": "昨天的詩，萊內先生寫出了我們的相見恨晚之感，那麼自然我也打算作一首詩贈予他。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726930103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "大伴"
				},
				{
					"id": 726930103,
					"content": "能得到大伴先生的贈詩，我可真是太榮幸了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726930104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "萊內"
				},
				{
					"id": 726930104,
					"content": "雖說我已經是個老頭子了，但最近結識了數位蒙德朋友後，我也對蒙德產生了不小的興趣。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726930105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "大伴"
				},
				{
					"id": 726930105,
					"content": "這首詩我仿照了蒙德吟遊詩人的寫法，詩句中還會提到一些蒙德的景物。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726930106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "大伴"
				},
				{
					"id": 726930106,
					"content": "#可惜我不曾去過蒙德，不知道這位{M#小哥}{F#姑娘}，能否幫我拍攝一些<color=#00E1FFFF>蒙德的特產</color>？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726930107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "大伴"
				},
				{
					"id": 726930107,
					"content": "交給我吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726930108
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 726930108,
					"content": "#哈哈，{M#小哥}{F#姑娘}，那就勞煩{F#妳}{M#你}了。與前幾日一樣，要四張畫片就行。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "大伴"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7269302,
			"completionStepIds": [],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
