				},
				{
					"id": 726930902,
					"content": "還沒有拍完…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726930903
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 726930903,
					"content": "辛苦了。今天要拍的是<color=#00E1FFFF>蒙德特產</color>，數量嘛，還是和之前一樣，<color=#00E1FFFF>四張</color>便可。",
